#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.desktop.in:6
#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:7
msgid "ValaPad"
msgstr "ValaPad"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.desktop.in:7
msgid "Edit plain-text files"
msgstr "Редактируйте текстовые файлы"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.desktop.in:8
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.desktop.in:10
msgid "valapad;text;editor;plain;"
msgstr "valapad;текст;редактор;обычный текст;"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.desktop.in:21
msgid "New Window"
msgstr "Новое окно"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:8
#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:22
msgid "Edit plain-text files with a familiar set of tools"
msgstr "Редактируйте текстовые файлы с помощью знакомых инструментов"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid "Iaroslav Angliuster"
msgstr "Ярослав Англюстер"

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:13
msgid ""
"ValaPad is a lightweight plain-text editor with a familiar menu bar and a "
"live status bar showing line and column, zoom level, line-ending style, and "
"encoding. Exciting!"
msgstr ""
"ValaPad — лёгкий редактор текста с привычной строкой меню и динамической "
"строкой состояния, которая показывает строку и столбец, масштаб, тип "
"окончания строк и кодировку."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:26
msgid "Recover unsaved documents after a crash"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:41
msgid ""
"Escape closes the search and replace bar, and the go to, font and recovery "
"dialogs."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:42
msgid ""
"Errors open in a proper dialog instead of an alert that printed the message "
"twice."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:43
msgid ""
"Cancelling the prompt for a binary or oversized file no longer leaves an "
"empty window behind."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:44
msgid "Monospace fonts no longer appear under Sans Serif in the font dialog."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:45
msgid "The About dialog shows the website, the author and the translators."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:50
msgid "Fixes related to the release on GitHub, no visual changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:55
msgid ""
"The autosave feature has been added. ValaPad regularly saves your changes, "
"so if app crashes, you can still restore the document."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:60
msgid "Changed strings related to RDNN change, no visual changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:65
msgid "Fixed link to the screenshot of the app."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:70
msgid "Changed RDNN string to previous one."
msgstr "Прежний идентификатор RDNN восстановлен."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:71
msgid "Fixed Russian and German translations."
msgstr "Исправлены переводы на русский и немецкий языки."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:72
msgid "Currently used font is now highlighted in fonts menu."
msgstr "Используемый шрифт теперь выделен в меню шрифтов."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:77
#, fuzzy
msgid "Changed the application ID to meet AppCenter publishing requirements."
msgstr "Идентификатор RDNN изменён в соответствии с требованиями публикации."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:82
msgid "Added the icon."
msgstr "Добавлен значок приложения."

#: data/dev.mysh.valapad.metainfo.xml.in.in:87
msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Первый релиз."

